24
00:00:38,834 --> 00:00:39,954
Con el cartucho completo,

25
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:41,754
la corriente normal entra

26
00:00:41,754 --> 00:00:42,774
por un contacto,

27
00:00:43,014 --> 00:00:44,534
atraviesa el elemento y

28
00:00:44,534 --> 00:00:45,274
