29
00:00:45,952 --> 00:00:47,632
El circuito permanece cerrado.

30
00:00:48,358 --> 00:00:49,558
Si la sobrecorriente es

31
00:00:49,558 --> 00:00:50,838
intensa o dura lo

32
00:00:50,838 --> 00:00:52,378
suficiente, el metal se

33
00:00:52,378 --> 00:00:53,698
